# "If two cards that share a card type were milled": with a single card left in the library only one is milled, so there is no pair to share a type and nothing
# is drawn (an empty library would lose Bot1 the game at its next draw, CR 704.5b, not before). The Island goes to the graveyard beside the sacrificed Black Lotus.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
The Tale of Tamiyo
Island x5
Island

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x24

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.The Tale of Tamiyo.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Island; Black Lotus
Bot1.Hand.Count = 5
Bot1.Library.Count = 0
Result = InProgress
